---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/1f6a18f12f08.webp" alt="表紙" width="2400" height="1218" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">スイカのたねをのんじゃった - 2021</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-extrabold text-[18px] mb:text-2xl leading-8 font-jp">スイカのたねをのんじゃった</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">文・イラスト：Thuy An</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">・本作は、文芸社の第21回絵本大賞でノミネート上位10作品に選ばれました。</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://www.bungeisha.co.jp/ehon/result21.jsp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">https://www.bungeisha.co.jp/ehon/result21.jsp</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">・本作の展示歴：</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">- シンガポール開催の AFCC 2023「Vietnam Country of Focus」展<br>- ベトナム日本大使館での「絵本ウィーク（本のつながる週間）」に、ベトナム人作家5名のひとりとして展示。日越外交関係樹立50周年を記念して開催されました。</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://shopee.vn/Combo-4-S%C3%A1ch-%C6%AF%C6%A1m-M%E1%BA%A7m-C%E1%BA%A3m-X%C3%BAc-cho-b%C3%A9-3-6-tu%E1%BB%95i-T%E1%BB%9B-%C3%B4m-c%E1%BA%ADu-%C4%91%C6%B0%E1%BB%A3c-kh%C3%B4ng-B%E1%BA%A1n-G%E1%BA%A5u-l%C3%A0m-Con-%E1%BB%A9-c%E1%BA%AFt-t%C3%B3c-L%E1%BB%A1-nu%E1%BB%91t-h%E1%BA%A1t-d%C6%B0a-h%E1%BA%A5u-i.157598084.14483051195" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">・ベトナムでの出版はこちら。</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word"><a href="https://www.yomo-ehon.com/products/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2">・日本での出版はこちら。</a></p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">この絵本の制作は、私にとって大きな挑戦でした。ちょうど気持ちに余裕のない時期と重なっていたからです。留学とアルバイトで時間が限られていましたが、日本の絵本コンクールに応募することを決めました。一位は取れませんでしたが、ベトナム人としてただひとり上位10作品に選ばれたことは大きな名誉でした。物語は、頭から木が生えてくるという子どものころの言い伝えから生まれました。この本がより多くの読者に届き、ベトナム人作家の絵本を知ってもらえたら嬉しいです。ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="作品">
        <h2 class="sr-only">作品</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/61a695b1e9f4.webp" alt="作品 1" width="1177" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/0a7977da1212.webp" alt="作品 2" width="1186" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/be740ce6a603.webp" alt="作品 3" width="1169" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ada8f7fa80d9.webp" alt="作品 4" width="1197" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/95920d0635c9.webp" alt="作品 5" width="1183" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ffd8527a2bf3.webp" alt="作品 6" width="1161" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/2128b440d540.webp" alt="作品 7" width="2200" height="1119" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/7a2f41da8822.webp" alt="作品 8" width="2200" height="1119" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/f87651deeba1.webp" alt="作品 9" width="1175" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/8f4533b9ceeb.webp" alt="作品 10" width="1197" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/df0bb3830ca5.webp" alt="作品 11" width="1162" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/e2857749c86b.webp" alt="作品 12" width="1200" height="1171" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/6a3fb4d08bbd.webp" alt="作品 13" width="1194" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/a296023dc8b5.webp" alt="作品 14" width="1162" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/e066aae831e7.webp" alt="作品 15" width="2200" height="1125" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/f5700a801e76.webp" alt="作品 16" width="2200" height="1129" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/c2a720693e81.webp" alt="締めくくりのイラスト" width="816" height="722" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/jp/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="もどる" title="もどる"></a>
    </article>
